(208, 2, 17, 12, 14, 19, 'MSc Cyber Security', 'msc-cyber-security', '£', '17100', '2000', NULL, NULL, '<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>You should hold at least a 2.2 Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with honour related to a computing or engineering discipline.</p>\r\n\r\n	<p>The Bachelor&rsquo;s degree must have provided you with a solid foundation to enable you to begin the MSc Cyber Security with some prior knowledge of computing, cyber security, data management and analysis.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 'university-of-gloucestershire-msc-cyber-security', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 16, NULL, '2024-07-11 04:28:07', '2024-07-11 04:28:07'),
