(236, 2, 17, 12, 15, 20, 'BA (Hons) Accounting and Business Management', 'ba-hons-accounting-and-business-management', '£', '16600', '2000', NULL, NULL, '<p>Successful completion of the Higher Secondary Certificate (HSC) plus completion of a recognised foundation course or successful completion of the Higher Secondary Certificate (HSC) with a GPA of 4.5/A grades or above. Please note that some courses may require higher entry requirements. Applicants are advised to check the course page, and/or conditions stated in the offer letter.</p>', '<p>In partnership with the British Council and the GREAT Britain Campaign, University of Gloucestershire is offering a scholarships to students in Bangladesh applying for postgraduate courses in MA Education and MSc Psychology.&nbsp;The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.glos.ac.uk/finance/international-funding/#great\">scholarship programme</a>&nbsp;offers financial support of a minimum of &pound;10,000 to students pursuing one-year postgraduate study in the UK.</p>', 'university-of-gloucestershire-ba-hons-accounting-and-business-management', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 16, NULL, '2024-07-11 06:27:06', '2024-07-11 06:27:06'),
