(397, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MSc Digital Marketing Management', 'msc-digital-marketing-management', '£', '20050', '1500', 'Want to study MSc Digital Marketing Management at Coventry University? Check the scholarship entry requirements and key features of this course', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This course covers all the key areas of digital marketing, including creating and managing marketing strategies, measuring and improving their effectiveness, and leading in the industry. Here&rsquo;s what makes this course great.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- Hands-On Experience: You&rsquo;ll have the chance to use the latest technology in Coventry&rsquo;s DigiComm Lab (if available), a special space just for marketing students.<br />\r\n- Relevant Modules: You&rsquo;ll learn about important topics like disruptive technologies and managing digital marketing projects, which are crucial for a career in digital marketing.<br />\r\n- Professional Certification: Coventry University is a Chartered Institute of Marketing (CIM) accredited study centre. After finishing this course, you can top up your master&rsquo;s degree to earn a CIM *-- Professional Diploma in Marketing (fees and application criteria apply).<br />\r\n- Autonomous Learning: The course is designed to help you become an independent learner who can blend theory with practice and use research to improve your skills as a future digital marketing manager.<br />\r\n- Personal Expertise: You&rsquo;ll develop your area of expertise through a Postgraduate Dissertation or Consultancy Project.</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Bangladesh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For 4-Year Degrees: If you have completed a 4-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 65% or higher, you qualify.<br />\r\n- For 3-Year Degrees: If you have a 3-year degree from these universities&mdash;NSU, Brac, IUB, East West, AIUB, Bangladesh University of Professional, or BUET&mdash;you need at least 55%. For other 3-year degrees, you need an overall score of 65% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:</strong><br />\r\n- You need a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no less than 5.5 in each section.<br />\r\n- Alternatively, you can have a TOEFL iBT score of 88 with at least 19 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>India</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For 3-Year Degrees: You need to have at least 60% in a 3-year undergraduate degree.<br />\r\n- For 4-Year Degrees: You need at least 55% in a 4-year undergraduate degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Universities with Different Requirements:</strong><br />\r\n- If you have a 3-year degree from these universities (unless applying for Health and Life Science courses), you need at least 55%: Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai (Madras), Anna, Amity, Andhra Pradesh, Aligarh Muslim, Pune, Bangalore, and JNTU.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:</strong><br />\r\nStandard XII English Language: You need 65% from certain boards like Central boards, Maharashtra, West Bengal, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Kerala, and Uttarakhand.<br />\r\nOR<br />\r\nEnglish Test Scores: You need an IELTS score of 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5 (unless the course requires higher scores). Other accepted tests include the Pearson Test of English</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Pakistan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nFor a 3-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 3-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 60% from a recognized university.<br />\r\n<strong>And</strong><br />\r\n- You must have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n- For a 4-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 4-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree with an overall score of 55% from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\n- You must have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n- For a 2-year Degree Plus a 2-year Master&rsquo;s Degree: You need to have 60% overall from a 2-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree and a 2-year master&rsquo;s degree. You must have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ghana</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or Postgraduate Diploma with at least a 2:2 grade or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or an equivalent English score (WASSCE English with a minimum grade of C).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>Kenya</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nIf you have an HND (Higher National Diploma) and 5 years of relevant work experience.<br />\r\nOr<br />\r\nIf you have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or higher.<br />\r\n<strong>And</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\nNigeria</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Admission Requirements<br />\r\nYou need a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or 55% or higher.<br />\r\nEnglish requirements<br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or an equivalent English score (WAEC English with a minimum grade of C).</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Save on Your Tuition Fees! Get &pound;3,000 off your course fees with our Vice-Chancellor Postgraduate Scholarship. Plus, you can receive an extra &pound;2,000 Early Payment Discount, depending on terms and conditions.</p>', 'null', 'MSc Digital Marketing Management | Coventry University', 'MSc Digital Marketing Management | Coventry University', NULL, NULL, 1, 16, 15, '2024-07-13 07:13:56', '2024-09-23 04:00:20'),
(398, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MSc Finance', 'msc-finance', '£', '20050', '1500', 'Want to study MSc Digital Marketing Management at Coventry University? Check the scholarship entry requirements and key features of this course', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This course covers all the key areas of digital marketing, including creating and managing marketing strategies, measuring and improving their effectiveness, and leading in the industry. Here&rsquo;s what makes this course great.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- Hands-On Experience: You&rsquo;ll have the chance to use the latest technology in Coventry&rsquo;s DigiComm Lab (if available), a special space just for marketing students.<br />\r\n- Relevant Modules: You&rsquo;ll learn about important topics like disruptive technologies and managing digital marketing projects, which are crucial for a career in digital marketing.<br />\r\n- Professional Certification: Coventry University is a Chartered Institute of Marketing (CIM) accredited study centre. After finishing this course, you can top up your master&rsquo;s degree to earn a CIM Professional Diploma in Marketing (fees and application criteria apply).<br />\r\n- Autonomous Learning: The course is designed to help you become an independent learner who can blend theory with practice and use research to improve your skills as a future digital marketing manager.<br />\r\n- Personal Expertise: You&rsquo;ll develop your area of expertise through a Postgraduate Dissertation or Consultancy Project.</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Bangladesh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For 4-Year Degrees: If you have completed a 4-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 65% or higher, you qualify.<br />\r\n- For 3-Year Degrees: If you have a 3-year degree from these universities&mdash;NSU, Brac, IUB, East West, AIUB, Bangladesh University of Professional, or BUET&mdash;you need at least 55%. For other 3-year degrees, you need an overall score of 65% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:</strong><br />\r\n- You need a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no less than 5.5 in each section.<br />\r\n- Alternatively, you can have a TOEFL iBT score of 88 with at least 19 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>India</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For 3-Year Degrees: You need to have at least 60% in a 3-year undergraduate degree.<br />\r\n- For 4-Year Degrees: You need at least 55% in a 4-year undergraduate degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Universities with Different Requirements:</strong><br />\r\nIf you have a 3-year degree from these universities (unless applying for Health and Life Science courses), you need at least 55%: Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai (Madras), Anna, Amity, Andhra Pradesh, Aligarh Muslim, Pune, Bangalore, and JNTU.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:</strong><br />\r\nStandard XII English Language: You need 65% from certain boards like Central boards, Maharashtra, West Bengal, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Kerala, and Uttarakhand.<br />\r\nOR<br />\r\nEnglish Test Scores: You need an IELTS score of 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5 (unless the course requires higher scores). Other accepted tests include the Pearson Test of English</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Pakistan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For a 3-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 3-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 60% from a recognized university.<br />\r\n<strong>And</strong><br />\r\n- You must have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n- For a 4-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 4-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree with an overall score of 55% from a recognized institution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\nFor a 2-year Degree Plus a 2-year Master&rsquo;s Degree: You need to have 60% overall from a 2-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree and a 2-year master&rsquo;s degree. You must have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ghana</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or Postgraduate Diploma with at least a 2:2 grade or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or an equivalent English score (WASSCE English with a minimum grade of C).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>Kenya</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nIf you have an HND (Higher National Diploma) and 5 years of relevant work experience.<br />\r\n<strong>Or</strong><br />\r\nIf you have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or higher.<br />\r\n<strong>And</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>Nigeria</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or 55% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or an equivalent English score (WAEC English with a minimum grade of C).<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Save on Your Tuition Fees! Get &pound;3,000 off your course fees with our Vice-Chancellor Postgraduate Scholarship. Plus, you can receive an extra &pound;2,000 Early Payment Discount, depending on terms and conditions.</p>', 'null', 'MSc Finance | Coventry University', 'MSc Finance | Coventry University', NULL, NULL, 1, 16, 15, '2024-07-13 07:15:03', '2024-09-23 04:06:35'),
(399, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MSc Finance (with prof. experience)', 'msc-finance-with-prof-experience', '£', '24050', '1500', 'Want to study MSc Finance (with prof. experience) at Coventry University? Check the scholarship entry requirements and key features of this course', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This course is designed to prepare you for various careers in finance. It covers important topics like derivatives, portfolio theory, risk management, financial modelling, governance, and ethical finance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>What You&rsquo;ll Learn:</strong><br />\r\n- Essential Skills: You&rsquo;ll develop the skills needed to navigate the constantly changing and complex financial world.<br />\r\n- Specialization: After your first semester, you can choose to focus on finance, banking, or investment management, depending on your interests.<br />\r\n- Practical Experience: You&rsquo;ll get hands-on practice with financial, statistical, and econometric analysis and learn how to interpret and communicate financial information in real-life situations.<br />\r\n- Accreditation: The course is accredited by the Chartered Management Institute and includes a module where you can earn a Level 7 Certificate in Strategic Leadership and Management.</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Bangladesh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For 4-Year Degrees: You need to have completed a 4-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 65% or higher.<br />\r\n- For 3-Year Degrees: If you have a 3-year degree from these universities, you need at least 55%: NSU, Brac, IUB, East West, AIUB, Bangladesh University of Professional, or BUET. For other 3-year degrees, you need 65% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n- A UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or<br />\r\n- A TOEFL iBT score of 88 with at least 19 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>India</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For a 3-Year Degree: You need at least 60% in your 3-year undergraduate degree.<br />\r\n- For a 4-Year Degree: You need at least 55% in your 4-year undergraduate degree.<br />\r\n- For Specific Universities: If you have a 3-year degree from these universities, you need 55%: Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai (Madras), Anna, Amity, Andhra Pradesh, Aligarh Muslim, Pune, Bangalore, and JNTU. This does not apply to Health and Life Science courses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n- 65% in Standard XII English from certain boards (Central boards, Maharashtra, West Bengal, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Kerala, and Uttarakhand)<br />\r\n- OR an IELTS score of 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or another acceptable test like the Pearson Test of English (PTE).<br />\r\n- Alternative Option: If you don&rsquo;t meet these requirements, you can take the Coventry University English Test.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Pakistan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nFor a 3-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 3-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 60% from a recognized university.<br />\r\n<strong>And</strong><br />\r\n- You need an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n- For a 4-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 4-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree with an overall score of 55% from a recognized institution.<br />\r\n<strong>And</strong><br />\r\n- You need an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n- For a 2-year Bachelor&rsquo;s Plus 2-year Master&rsquo;s Degree: You need 60% overall from a 2-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree and a 2-year master&rsquo;s degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each part, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ghana</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or Postgraduate Diploma with at least a 2:2 grade or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or an equivalent English score (WASSCE English with a minimum grade of C).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>Kenya</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- You need an HND (Higher National Diploma) and 5 years of relevant work experience.<br />\r\n- You need a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Nigeria</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or 55% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or an equivalent English score (WAEC English with a minimum grade of C).</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Save on Your Tuition Fees! Get &pound;3,000 off your course fees with our Vice-Chancellor Postgraduate Scholarship. Plus, you can receive an extra &pound;2,000 Early Payment Discount, depending on terms and conditions.</p>', 'null', 'MSc Finance (with prof. experience) | Coventry University', 'MSc Finance (with prof. experience) |Coventry University', NULL, NULL, 1, 16, 15, '2024-07-13 07:15:32', '2024-09-23 04:24:55'),
(400, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MSc International Business Management', 'msc-international-business-management', '£', '20050', '1500', 'Want to study International Business Management at Coventry University? Check the scholarship entry requirements and key features of this course', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This course combines theory and practice to give you a strong foundation in international business management in a changing global economy.<br />\r\nYou&#39;ll learn how to become a flexible and effective manager who can identify market opportunities and help businesses succeed internationally.<br />\r\nThe course will cover:<br />\r\nHow modern organizations are structured and how people&#39;s behaviour affects performance.<br />\r\nHow markets for resources, goods, and services are developed and operated.<br />\r\nWhy You Should Study This Course<br />\r\nThis course is designed to:<br />\r\nTrain you to be a business professional who understands how businesses work and the broader context they operate.<br />\r\nHelp you understand and adapt to changes in international business.<br />\r\nEquip you to handle new global business trends and lead changes effectively.<br />\r\nCover various areas including management theory, operations, marketing, and human resources.<br />\r\nProvide a clear understanding of global trade and complex business issues worldwide.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Bangladesh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Requirements for Admission</strong><br />\r\n- You need to have completed a 4-year BA, BCom, or BSc with at least 65% overall.<br />\r\n- If you have a 3-year degree from one of these universities&mdash;NSU, Brac, IUB, East West, AIUB, Bangladesh University of Professional, or BUET&mdash;you only need 55% overall. For other 3-year degrees, you need 65% overall.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no less than 5.5 in each section, or a TOEFL iBT score of 88 with at least 19 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>India</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Requirements for Admission</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- You need to have 60% in a 3-year undergraduate degree or 55% in a 4-year undergraduate degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- If you have a 3-year degree from these universities&mdash;Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai (Madras), Anna, Amity, Andhra Pradesh, Aligarh Muslim, Pune, Bangalore, or JNTU&mdash;you need 55% overall. For health and life science courses, you&rsquo;ll need 60% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- You need to have 65% in English from Standard XII if you studied with certain boards (Central boards, Maharashtra, West Bengal, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Kerala, and Uttarakhand).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- Alternatively, you need an IELTS score of 6.5 overall with no part below 5.5, or a Pearson Test of English (PTE) score that meets the requirement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">- If you don&rsquo;t meet these English language requirements, you can take the Coventry University English Test.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Pakistan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Three-Year Degree:</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp; - You need to have completed a three-year BA/BCom/BSc with 60% overall from a recognized university.<br />\r\n&nbsp; - You must also have an IELTS score of 6.5 with at least 5.5 in each part, or a Pearson PTE score that matches this requirement. Alternatively, you can have 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n<strong>Four-Year Degree:</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp; - If you have a four-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree, you need to have 55% overall from a recognized institution.<br />\r\n&nbsp; - You also need an IELTS score of 6.5 with at least 5.5 in each part or a Pearson PTE score that meets this requirement. Alternatively, you can have 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n<strong>Two-Year Bachelor&rsquo;s and Two-Year Master&rsquo;s:</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp; - You need 60% overall from a two-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree and a two-year Master&rsquo;s degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou also need an IELTS score of 6.5 with at least 5.5 in each part or a Pearson PTE score that matches this requirement. Alternatively, you can have 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ghana</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Requirements for Admission</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or Postgraduate Diploma with at least a 2:2 grade.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must also have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no less than 5.5 in each part. Alternatively, you can meet this requirement with WASSCE English at grade C or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kenya</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Requirements for Admission</strong><br />\r\n- If you have an HND and 5 years of relevant work experience.<br />\r\n- If you have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no less than 5.5 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Nigeria</strong><br />\r\n<strong>Requirements for Admission</strong><br />\r\nYou need a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least a 2:2 grade or 55% or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&nbsp;English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section, or a WAEC English score of at least C.</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Save on Your Tuition Fees! Get &pound;3,000 off your course fees with our Vice-Chancellor Postgraduate Scholarship. Plus, you can receive an extra &pound;2,000 Early Payment Discount, depending on terms and conditions.</p>', 'null', 'MSc International Business Management | Coventry University', 'MSc International Business Management | Coventry University', NULL, NULL, 1, 16, 15, '2024-07-13 07:20:43', '2024-09-23 04:48:49'),
(401, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MSc Digital Marketing with Data Analytics', 'msc-digital-marketing-with-data-analytics', '£', '20050', '1500', NULL, NULL, '<p>Undergraduate: 65% or GPA of 3.5 out of 5 scales.<br />\r\nPostgraduate: 65% or CGPA of 3 out of 4 scales in Bachelor&#39;s Degree.</p>', NULL, 'coventry-university-msc-digital-marketing-with-data-analytics', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 16, NULL, '2024-07-13 07:21:19', '2024-07-13 07:21:19'),
(402, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MBA Global Business', 'mba-global-business', '£', '20050', '1500', NULL, NULL, '<p>Undergraduate: 65% or GPA of 3.5 out of 5 scales.<br />\r\nPostgraduate: 65% or CGPA of 3 out of 4 scales in Bachelor&#39;s Degree.</p>', NULL, 'coventry-university-mba-global-business', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 16, 15, '2024-07-13 07:29:05', '2024-08-03 10:01:36'),
(403, 2, 20, 15, 20, 27, 'MSc FinTech', 'msc-fintech', '£', '20050', '1500', 'Want to study MSc FinTech at Coventry University? Check the scholarship entry requirements and key features of this course', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;This course is designed to help you start exciting careers in areas like investment banking, financial services, and financial technology (FinTech).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>What You&rsquo;ll Learn:</strong><br />\r\n- Fundamentals: You&rsquo;ll get a strong foundation in important financial topics like derivatives, corporate finance, and quantitative methods.<br />\r\n- FinTech Focus: The course then dives into the growing field of FinTech, teaching you about managing risks and applying FinTech in real-world financial firms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br />\r\n<strong>Accreditation and Opportunities:</strong><br />\r\n- Chartered Management Institute: The course is accredited by the Chartered Management Institute, and includes a module where you can earn a Level 7 Certificate in Strategic Management and Leadership Practice.<br />\r\n- Professional Experience: You may have the chance to apply for a professional experience opportunity to boost your skills and improve your job prospects.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Additional Info:</strong><br />\r\nCoventry Business School is part of the Chartered Association of Business Schools, which helps maintain high standards of teaching and research.</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Bangladesh</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For a 4-Year Degree: You need to have completed a 4-year BA, BCom, or BSc with an overall score of 65%.<br />\r\n- For a 3-Year Degree: If you graduated from one of these universities, you need at least 55%: NSU, Brac, IUB, East West, AIUB, Bangladesh University of Professional, or BUET. For other 3-year degrees, you need 65% overall.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n- A UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or<br />\r\n- A TOEFL iBT score of 88, with a minimum score of 19 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>India</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n- For a 3-Year Degree: You need at least 60% overall.<br />\r\n- For a 4-Year Degree: You need at least 55% overall.<br />\r\n- Specific Universities: If you graduated from one of these universities, you need 55% in your 3-year degree (unless you&rsquo;re applying for Health and Life Science courses): Delhi, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai (Madras), Anna, Amity, Andhra Pradesh, Aligarh Muslim, Pune, Bangalore, and JNTU.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English Language Requirements:</strong><br />\r\n- 65% in Standard XII English from certain boards (Central boards, Maharashtra, West Bengal, Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, Andhra Pradesh, Kerala, and Uttarakhand) or<br />\r\n- An IELTS score of 6.5 overall, with no part lower than 5.5, or<br />\r\n- A Pearson Test of English (PTE) score that is acceptable.<br />\r\n- Alternative: If you don&rsquo;t meet the above, you can take the Coventry University English Test.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Pakistan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\n-For a 3-Year Degree:<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp;-You need to have a BA, BCom, or BSc with at least 60% overall from a recognized university.<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp;-You must also have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">-For a 4-Year Degree:<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; - You need to have a 4-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree with at least 55% overall from a recognized institution.<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; - You must also have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.<br />\r\n- For a 2-Year Bachelor&rsquo;s + 2-Year Master&rsquo;s Degree:<br />\r\n&nbsp; &nbsp; -You need to have 60% overall from a 2-year bachelor&rsquo;s degree and a 2-year master&rsquo;s degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must also have an IELTS or Pearson PTE score of 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section, or 70% in HSSC/FA/FSC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ghana</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree or Postgraduate Diploma with a grade of 2:2 or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must also have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section, or an equivalent score (like a WASSCE English grade of C).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kenya</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have an HND (Higher National Diploma) and 5 years of relevant work experience. Or, you can have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with a grade of 2:2 or higher.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must also have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Nigeria</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admission Requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou need to have a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree with a grade of 2:2 or 55% or higher.<br />\r\n<strong>English requirements</strong><br />\r\nYou must also have a UKVI IELTS score of at least 6.5 overall, with at least 5.5 in each section, or an equivalent score (like a WAEC English grade of C).</p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Save on Your Tuition Fees! Get &pound;3,000 off your course fees with our Vice-Chancellor Postgraduate Scholarship. Plus, you can receive an extra &pound;2,000 Early Payment Discount, depending on terms and conditions.</p>', 'null', 'MSc FinTech | Coventry University', 'MSc FinTech | Coventry University', NULL, NULL, 1, 16, 15, '2024-07-13 09:16:08', '2024-09-23 04:39:01'),
